<h2>Welcome to {{title}}</h2>
<p>Your mouse and keyboard work as the Amiga's own.</p>
<div class="row"><span class="label">{{menu_key}}</span><span>menu: disks, save states, settings</span></div>
<div class="row" data-if="state_keys"><span class="label">F5 / F9</span><span>quick save / quick load</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">F12</span><span>screenshot</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">Alt+Enter</span><span>fullscreen on / off</span></div>
<div class="row" data-if="controls"><span class="label">arrows</span><span>joystick; Right Ctrl fires. Rebind them on the menu's Controls page.</span></div>
